  "problem": "The table below gives the values of a continuous function $f(x)$ over the closed interval $[2,8]$ with a regular step size.\n\n| $x$ | $2$ | $4$ | $6$ | $8$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $-3$ | $5$ | $k$ | $1$ |\n\nIf the left Riemann sum approximation of the area under the curve $y=f(x)$ with $3$ subintervals defined by the given points has a value of $18$, then what must be the value of $k?$ \n\n$\\,\\,k=$\n{{field-1}}",
